# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# olympia-brand — .gitignore
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything not ignored here is world-readable the
# moment it is pushed. Never remove the SECURITY blocks.
#
# This repo has no package manager and installs nothing. `scripts/` holds
# dependency-free Node and shell commands you run by hand, so there is no
# node_modules/ or build-output section. Add the ecosystem's artifact patterns
# only if that changes.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# == SECURITY: secrets & credentials ==
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
credentials.json
service-account.json
*.credentials
secrets/
.secrets/
*.secret

# == SECURITY: SSH / signing key material ==
# Extensionless by design — *.key and *.pem do not match these.
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519

# == SECURITY: package-registry auth ==
# These carry registry tokens. A committed .npmrc can also silently weaken
# install-time supply-chain settings for anyone who runs a package manager here.
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.yarnrc.yml

# == SECURITY: wallet / node key material ==
keystore/
*.keystore
wallet.json
mnemonic.txt

# == Local working files — never travel ==
.local/
SESSION_NOTES.md
PLANNING.md
SCRATCH.md
*.scratch.*
*.draft.*

# == Claude Code ==
# This directory is TRACKED so repo-local agents, skills and rules travel with
# the repo. Only machine-local and agent-written state is held back. Do not
# invert this into a blanket ignore: an agent inside an ignored directory never
# reaches a clone, and root CLAUDE.md is the file that loads AGENTS.md at all.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/agent-memory-local/
.claude/launch.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/**/*.local.*
.claude/**/*-local/

# == OS ==
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# == Editors / IDE ==
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# == Logs / temp ==
*.log
logs/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.pid

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo-specific ignores BELOW this line:
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Render scratch — scripts/render-og.sh writes finished PNGs into social/,
# never here; anything landing in this directory is intermediate.
scripts/.render-tmp/
